摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH ChatGPT Free bridges standard ChatGPT Web directly into DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1357647610","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-chatgpt-web","slug":"WLV-ZEDD/dsh-chatgpt-web","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-market"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH ChatGPT Free bridges standard ChatGPT Web directly into DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-chatgpt-web"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **Zero-cost conversational AI model provider for DeepSeek Harness powered by free ChatGPT Web (GPT"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"st conversational AI model provider for DeepSeek Harness powered by free ChatGPT Web (GPT-6 Luna).**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Overview"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**dsh-chatgpt-web** turns your local browser session of ChatGPT into a seamless, **$0.00 API-free co"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"nversational model provider** directly inside DeepSeek Harness (DSH)."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"It connects via headless or visible Chrome/Chromium browser automation to `chatgpt.com`, streaming r"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"eal-time Markdown responses, code solutions, explanations, and reasoning back to your DSH chats with"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"out consuming API credits."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### Why Pure Chat?"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Small conversational web models (like GPT-6 Luna) excel at explanations, dialogue, Q&A;, brainstormi"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ng, code snippet generation, and side-assistant tasks. By running in **Pure Chat Mode**, the bridge "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"eliminates prompt overhead, tool hallucinations, and syntax errors of autonomous multi-tool executio"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"n loops, providing a fast, rock-solid, zero-cost LLM provider."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Key Features"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- **100% Free ($0.00 Cost):** Uses your existing free ChatGPT Web session. No OpenAI API keys or cre"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"dit cards needed.\n- **Cordis Plugin-First Lifecycle:** Managed by DSH via `ctx.effect`. DeepSeek Har"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ness starts the background sidecar automatically on launch and shuts it down on exit.\n- **Dynamic Mo"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"del Auto-Detection:** Automatically detects your ChatGPT tier:\n- **Free Accounts:** Defaults to `cha"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"tgpt-web/luna` (`gpt-5-6-luna`) and `chatgpt-web/think`.\n- **Plus / Team Accounts:** Automatically d"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"etects and exposes **GPT-6** (`chatgpt-web/gpt-6-light`, `medium`, `high`) and **GPT-5.6 Sol** (`cha"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"tgpt-web/light`, `medium`, `high`), plus Pro tiers when available.\n- **Full Streaming Markdown & Cod"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"e Blocks:** Delivers tokens in real time directly to the DSH Web UI or CLI.\n- **Portable, Validated "},{"id":"p11s9","text":"Artifacts:** The published tarball is validated by CI (clean install, runtime smoke test, dependency"},{"id":"p11s10","text":" resolution, no build-environment path contamination) before it can reach the registries."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- **Runtime:** Node.js `>=22.19.0` **or** Bun `>=1.3.0` (both are supported; the CLI runs on either)"},{"id":"p13s2","text":".\n- **DeepSeek Harness:** `>=0.2.0-rc.2`.\n- **Browser:** Chrome or Chromium on your machine (used fo"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"r the one-time sign-in and for serving)."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### 1. Installation"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Install the plugin directly from this GitHub repository:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"This registers the plugin in the profile's `package.json` bundles, so its Cordis entries are compose"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"d automatically — no manual `insert` is needed."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 2. One-Time Browser Sign-In"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Authenticate your ChatGPT account once. The plugin binary lives in the profile's `node_modules/.bin`"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"uthenticate your ChatGPT account once. The plugin binary lives in the profile's `node_modules/.bin`:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"A dedicated Chrome/Chromium window will open. Log into your OpenAI / ChatGPT account. Once the compo"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ser is visible and the ChatGPT session is authenticated, setup captures the session and writes the c"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"onfig and browser state to the plugin's storage directory (default `~/.dsh/storages/chatgpt-web/`). "},{"id":"p22s4","text":"A guest composer alone is not treated as a successful login."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"`--dsh` leaves Codex configuration and OS services untouched; DSH owns the sidecar lifecycle. Existi"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ng Codex or DEV storage cannot be repurposed by this command: use a separate `DSH_CHATGPT_WEB_HOME` "},{"id":"p23s3","text":"if needed. Before rerunning setup, stop or disable the sidecar so its port is free. Without `--dsh`,"},{"id":"p23s4","text":" the legacy Codex setup path remains unchanged."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"If your browser is not at the default path, pass it explicitly:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"#### Using a snap-confined browser (e.g. snap Chromium)"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Snap-confined browsers can only write to **non-hidden** paths in `$HOME`. The plugin's default stora"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ge directory (`~/.dsh/storages/chatgpt-web/`) is hidden, so a snap browser cannot create its profile"},{"id":"p27s3","text":" lock there and setup fails with:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The fix is to point the plugin's storage home at a **non-hidden** directory using the `DSH_CHATGPT_W"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"EB_HOME` environment variable."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"**How the variable works:** `VAR=value command` is standard shell syntax — it sets the environment v"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ariable *only for that one command* and does not persist it. The plugin reads `DSH_CHATGPT_WEB_HOME`"},{"id":"p30s3","text":" on startup; when set, every file it owns (config, browser profile, storage state) lives under that "},{"id":"p30s4","text":"directory instead of `~/.dsh/storages/chatgpt-web/`."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"**Step by step:**"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"1. **Run the one-time setup with the variable applied to the command:**"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The browser window opens; log in to ChatGPT. The session is saved under `~/dsh-chatgpt-web/`."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"2. **Persist the variable for the shell that starts DSH.** The background sidecar is started by Deep"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"Seek Harness and inherits DSH's environment — it does *not* inherit a one-off `VAR=value` prefix fro"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"m your terminal. So export the variable in your shell (e.g. `~/.bashrc`), then start DSH from that s"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"r terminal. So export the variable in your shell (e.g. `~/.bashrc`), then start DSH from that shell:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The sidecar now finds the same `config.json` and browser state that setup created."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"3. **Verify with the doctor** (run it in the same environment):"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"### 3. Enable in DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## Diagnostics & Health Check"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Verify your setup at any time with the built-in diagnostic doctor:"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"Example healthy output:"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"## Notes & Limitations"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"1. **Unofficial Bridge:** Operates via local Playwright browser automation on `chatgpt.com`. Not aff"},{"id":"p49s2","text":"iliated with or endorsed by OpenAI.\n2. **Single-Session Concurrency:** Runs within a single browser "},{"id":"p49s3","text":"tab. Sequential queries and normal DSH agent chats work seamlessly; avoid launching parallel multi-s"},{"id":"p49s4","text":"ubagent swarms against the same tab simultaneously.\n3. **Pure Chat Only:** This provider generates p"},{"id":"p49s5","text":"ure conversational responses, explanations, reasoning, and code blocks. It does not execute local fi"},{"id":"p49s6","text":"lesystem, terminal, or autonomous tool loops.\n4. **Standard Free Tier Rate Limits:** Subject to stan"},{"id":"p49s7","text":"dard OpenAI free-tier hourly usage limits."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
